        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.11+ISA.1.12+ISA.1.13+ISA.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 1.11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Nanga ibirori byanyu, ndabigaya, kandi ntabwo nezezwa no guterana kwanyu kwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho mwantambira ibitambo byoswa, mukantura amaturo y'amafu sinzabyemera, kandi sinzita ku bitambo byanyu by'uko ari amahoro by'amatungo yanyu abyibushye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkuraho urusaku rw'indirimbo zawe, kuko ntashaka kumva ijwi ry'inanga zawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahubwo ureke imanza zitabera zigende nk'amazi, no gukiranuka gukwire hose nk'uruzi rusandaye.",
