        },
        {
          "text": " “Mbese hari ibitambo n'amaturo mwanzaniye mu butayu muri ya myaka mirongo ine, mwa nzu ya Isirayeli mwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.25",
